        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: June Martino, Ray Kroc\n- Companies: McDonald’s Corporation, McDonald’s\n- Roles: bookkeeper, Corporate Secretary, Treasurer, Director, part-owner\n- Topics: business leadership, franchise expansion\n\nFacts:\n- June Martino was born on August 10, 1917, and died on January 29, 2005.\n- June Martino became Ray Kroc’s bookkeeper in 1948.\n- Ray Kroc joined the Californian chain McDonald’s in 1954.\n- Ray Kroc built McDonald’s into a nationwide and eventually global franchise.\n- Ray Kroc made McDonald’s the most successful fast food corporation in the world.\n- June Martino ultimately rose to become Corporate Secretary, Treasurer, Director, and part-owner of McDonald’s Corporation.",
